[00:00.84] Ṛṛuḥ-is ad d-yeselqaf
[00:15.12] Am uεeqqa gar iɣuraf
[00:24.30] Yettraǧu nnuba-s yettru umeḥbus-iw
[00:35.05] Yugad ad as-tinim d amcum
[00:47.24] Taggara ar tettum
[00:54.67] Ɣeṛ-s anwa a yarẓen asalu umeḥbus-iw
[01:05.81] Lbaṭel iger-d isuraf
[01:20.21] Ɣer sdat d lkaf
[01:28.32] Deffir-s lmut a d-tettedu umeḥbus-iw
[01:38.84] Siwel-as a yul-iw, siwel-as
