[02:52.44] Ɣef ccɣel ad yerz ufus-iw
[02:58.26] D tasa-w iyi-smendagen
[03:00.88] Tessibrik deg wussan-iw
[03:05.80] Ufiɣ imdanen la heddren
[03:08.37] Mi ḍalleɣ bran i wallen
[03:12.02] Ay aḍu d kečč ad iyi-mlen
[03:16.39] Ma mazal yedder neɣ ala umeḥbus-iw
[03:21.66]
[03:24.67] Ad d-yeggar wul nhati
[03:27.94] Mi d-yewweḍ uqebli n meɣres
[03:33.43] Mi refdeɣ abuqal s imi
[03:36.48] Ad d-tas lḥaǧa ad iyi-t-tekkes
[03:41.26] Ass-a ḥṣiɣ ifat-iyi
[03:43.78] Tiṭ dayen ur tettwali
[03:47.47] Ay aḍu qim-d mmel-iyi
[03:51.83] Anida i s-tebra lmuja i umeḥbus-iw
[03:56.91]
